      "Suggests commit types, scopes, subjects, bodies, and trailers.",
      "Creates pull request titles and structured descriptions.",
      "Provides author and reviewer checklists for pull requests.",
      "Guides rebasing, cherry-picking, stashing, and bisecting workflows.",
      "Supplies examples for common Git commit operations."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Git commands can change repository history and require review before execution.",
